<group prefix="WebGpuSharp">
	<comment location="BufferUsage">
		<summary> Describes how a buffer is expected to be used.</summary>
	</comment>
	<group prefix="BufferUsage.">
		<comment location="MapRead">
			<summary> 
				The buffer can be mapped for reading, for example when calling mapAsync() with
				a mode of GPUMapMode.READ. This flag may only be combined with
				GPUBufferUsage.COPY_DST. 
			</summary>
		</comment>
	</group>
</group>